  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3652706eb15a44b40b2da38c4c3e434b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 01_Introduction
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TreeDialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: Alderworn
    text: Slowly, little traveler. That was a heavy fall.
  - speaker: Alien
    text: The ship... I remember the flight, but not landing.
  - speaker: Alderworn
    text: You did not land gently. I lifted what I could.
  - speaker: Alien
    text: Your root. It's bleeding.
  - speaker: Alderworn
    text: It will mend. Can you stand?
  - speaker: Alien
    text: I think so. Where am I?
  - speaker: Alderworn
    text: Wyrmwood. My name is Alderworn.
  - speaker: Alien
    text: I need to contact my crew. The transmitter is damaged.
  - speaker: Alderworn
    text: Then rest beneath my branches. When you are ready, we will see what can be repaired.
